stateDiagram
    [*] --> INITIALIZING

    INITIALIZING --> READY : init ok / recover WAL intact
    INITIALIZING --> RECOVERING : recover WAL gap / corrupt
    INITIALIZING --> FAULTED : recover disk fail

    RECOVERING --> READY : AppendEntries / Snapshot ok
    READY --> INITIALIZING : recover start
    READY --> FAULTED : persist fail / shutdown
    RECOVERING --> FAULTED : persist fail / shutdown

    FAULTED --> [*]
